# Play view against the computer (tests/ui/records/vs-white-easy.5dr: Easy, you are White, T2w): a move, Submit, the computer's search frozen part-way
# (the cards show no chips while it thinks), its reply flown onto the card, and the next turn starting in the Play view again.
startplayview on
record ../records/vs-white-easy.5dr
wait 90
camexpect playview 1
clicksq 0 2 g1
wait 20
clicksq 0 2 f3
wait 30
ainodes 1
click 841 90         # Submit
move 1380 600
wait 20
ainodes 0
wait 5
capture play-view-vs-thinking
ainodes 400
waitai
wait 40
camexpect playview 1
capture play-view-vs-reply
